      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t02_09",
      "hash64": "B8FB8FABB6AECF85",
      "text": "解麻藥寄來了！\\n這個道具能治療陷入麻痺狀態的寶可夢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t02_10",
      "hash64": "B8FEFCABB6B1BE93",
      "text": "在對戰時會最先上場的是\\n同行隊伍中排在最前面的寶可夢喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t02_11",
      "hash64": "B8FEFBABB6B1BCE0",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t02_12",
      "hash64": "B8FEFEABB6B1C1F9",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳穿著制服，看來是個學生啊。\\c\\n身上最多可以帶著６隻寶可夢，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不妨可以帶好帶滿。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
