        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t02_13",
      "hash64": "B8FEFDABB6B1C046",
      "text": "我啊～平時都在學校啊～\\n學習有關寶可夢的事喔！\\c\\n寶可夢可以學會的招式\\n最多到４個喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t02_14",
      "hash64": "B8FF00ABB6B1C55F",
      "text": "住在平碟鎮的學生不住在宿舍，\\n而是從自己家裡通學！\\r\\n……坡道很辛苦就是了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
